# A control answering the hand on a computer (docs/motion.md, kind 7): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up chat. ⌘,
# then 密钥, a secret's page: the pointer on 编辑 and away, its ground in and out over --dur.
timeout 30000
until 发消息
wait 600
key cmd+,
wait 1000
tap 密钥
wait 1500
move 800 500
wheel 900
wait 900
tap GitHub token
wait 1500
hover 编辑
wait 500
move 800 700
wait 600
exit
